# 06 — Count-Based Window (every 3 events)
# Batch 1: 10, 20, 30 → avg 20.0
# Batch 2: 40, 50, 60 → avg 50.0

SensorReading { temperature: 10 }
SensorReading { temperature: 20 }
SensorReading { temperature: 30 }
SensorReading { temperature: 40 }
SensorReading { temperature: 50 }
SensorReading { temperature: 60 }
